o that diagonal operator, and the negative part of the spectrum is exhausted by the bound states of [[thm-nrqm-coulomb-negative-subspace-completeness-and-degeneracy]] while the positive part is purely absolutely continuous.\n\nThe transform is a mathematical spectral representation of $A_l$ and $C$; no\nscattering amplitude, phase shift or physical interpretation is asserted.",
